■ JCROSS_FRAG_b3e653ae
【状態】 確定
【主体】 Ergonomics Look for chair
【関係】 provides
【客体】 proper lumbar support encourages good posture allows you to sit with your feet flat on floor on footrest with your knees at below hip level

[L2_Archive]
**Ergonomics**: Look for a chair that provides proper lumbar support, encourages good posture, and allows you to sit with your feet flat on the floor or on a footrest, with your knees at or below hip level.

■ JCROSS_FRAG_e1c23f1f
【状態】 確定
