**Seat Height and Depth**: The seat should be adjustable in height and depth to fit your body.

■ JCROSS_FRAG_94a1cf57
【状態】 確定
【主体】 good chair should allow you to sit with your
【関係】 thighs
【客体】 parallel to floor with 2-4 inches of space between back of your knees seat edge

[L2_Archive]
A good chair should allow you to sit with your thighs parallel to the floor, with about 2-4 inches of space between the back of your knees and the seat edge.

